amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/733750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1572519547","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/733750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1572519547","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":780470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>New DLC &quot;Steel Eagle - Cave mission&quot; is available now</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/header_DLC_Cave.png?t=1522914802\" /></span><br>In the newest DLC you will find 20 levels in the new scenery of caves with narrow corridors and <br><br>chambers. New difficulties have also been added in the form of a collision with slopes and rub on the <br><br>rocks. As in the basic version of the game, there are two difficulty modes: EASY and NORM.</p><br><h1>Try for free DEMO version of the game</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/header_FREE_DEMO.png?t=1522914802\" /></span><br>A cut-down version of the full game is now available to download as a Demo. Look for the \u201eDownload Demo\u201d button on the Store page.<br><br>In the free demo of the game, players can know with the mechanics of the game. Two cut-down levels are available.<br><br>In the demo version there isn't available to unlock the limit to 60 FPS.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/picture1_800x100.png?t=1517933467\" /></span><br><br>Steel Eagle is a reference to classic arcade top-down view shooters with a scrolled map. Lead the Steel Eagle safely through 20 levels, destroying as many enemies as possible on the way. At the end of each level there is a landing pad waiting for you, which allows you to move to the next level. Of course, the landing pad is guarded by enemies.<br>Once you reach the landing pad you will be able to exchange the points for additional force and strength of your \u201cSteel Eagle\u201d.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/picture2_800x100.png?t=1517933467\" /></span><br><br>Main features:<br>- 20 different levels.<br>- simple vehicle development system, but giving the chance to try different development options.<br>- the ability to unlock the FPS if the standard speed of the game will be too slow for you (test how many frames will take your computer!).<br><br>Sit at the controls of the \u201cSteel Eagle\u201d and get the most points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/picture3_800x100.png?t=1517933467\" /></span>","developers":["enrju"],"dlc":[823140],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/733750/header.jpg?t=1572519547","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/733750/145843/50e502d2b92e8884b0449f03ee0a63abde52f24d/1751137679/dash_av1.mpd?t=1520680528","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/733750/145843/50e502d2b92e8884b0449f03ee0a63abde52f24d/1751137679/dash_h264.mpd?t=1520680528","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/733750/145843/50e502d2b92e8884b0449f03ee0a63abde52f24d/1751137679/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1520680528","id":256708079,"name":"zwiastun_1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamst